 Severity decisive for C-NEW-KB-QMA1 and C-NEW-KB-DEQUANT.
 
 Ranking before arm B is worth a prover seat:
 **K-KB11 > K-KB6 > K-KB12 > K-KB3 > K-KB9 > K-KB1 > K-KB7 > K-KB4 > K-KB5 > K-KB2 > K-KB8 > K-KB10.**
 
